@startuml
start
:Director becomes unavailable;
:Film refreshes operational state;
if (Missing crew is VIP?) then (yes)
  :Enter VIPMissing;
  :Reject start and finish actions;
else (no)
  :Enter OtherMissing;
endif
:Crew member returns;
:Film refreshes operational state;
if (All required crew present?) then (yes)
  :Return to Shooting;
else (no)
  :Remain in missing-crew state;
endif
stop
@enduml